      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 197
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "wo hota hai mind ka us event ko baar-baar replay karna "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek baar nahi… do baar nahi… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 199
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "par continuously… jab tak wo cheez “reality” jaisi feel na hone lage. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 200
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahi pe real shift start hota hai: "
        }
